<div class="text aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--10 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
<div id="text-ec66b14a74" class="cmp-text">
    <p>With more than 635 million entities and companies within Orbis, Moody&#39;s now delivers even more extensive data for our customers. More data means more actionable insights to manage risk, act decisively and advance their business.</p>

</div>

    

