        <div class="tabs-tab tabs-tab-m">
            <span class="tabs-tab-number">02</span>
            
            <span class="tabs-tab-text">Public sector</span>
        </div>
        <div id="tabs-57e07d41e1-item-c3a4436a90-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-57e07d41e1-item-c3a4436a90-tab" tabindex="-1" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;tabs-57e07d41e1-item-c3a4436a90&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/tabs/v1/tabs/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Public sector&#34;}}">
            <!-- check -->
            <div class="container responsivegrid bg-light-grey p-t-96">

    
    <div id="container-c3a4436a90" class="cmp-container container-preview">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title h6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
  <div id="title-0d1f79db65" class="cmp-title">
 <h2 class="cmp-title__text">Public sector</h2>
</div>

    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="text-5a5f317282" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Our customers need to access data and insights that help them make more informed decisions.</p>
<p>We continuously source data from both internal and external sources—optimizing it to create an accessible and valuable data repository. Our private and public entity database is one of the world&#39;s largest, comprising over 635 million entities, over 540 million individuals, and 2 billion ownership links. It includes company financials, mergers and acquisitions, patent and intellectual property information, as well as spending and payment data.</p>
<p>We offer proprietary credit ratings by Moody’s Ratings for listed companies and governments worldwide, real-time news solutions, and an array of ratings and scores as well as physical and transition risk data—enabling a holistic risk assessment for your business.</p>
<p>Our data supports government agencies across domains, including security, trade, investments, policy formulation, financial management, and educational research.</p>
<p>Government agencies utilize our verifiable datasets at both micro and macro levels. These encompass technology insights, credit, financial, and reputational risk assessments, environmental data and data related to foreign direct investments, complex corporate structures, mergers and acquisitions, patent and intellectual property, Politically Exposed Persons (PEPs), sanctions, and adverse media incidents.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button btn-quick-link aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">




<a id="button-1d1da0486f" class="cmp-button " data-linktype="link" href="/web/en/us/who-we-serve/public-sector.html">
    
    

    <span class="cmp-button__text ">More on public sector</span>
</a>

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

        </div>
        
    </div>
<div class="tabs-content-wrapper">
        
